Requirement: Master every Cinematic Technique and critically succeed with a Cinematic Skill in consequential combat.

Unlock: Gain the fourth Style Shido, gain permission to purchase qualifying Tradition Advantages offered by the Wuxia Tradition, and gain the ability to teach the Style. Qualification still obeys every catalog prerequisite; an entry that depends on a Supernatural Unlock family remains unavailable until that family has actually opened.
